# Golden G-M4-1: the three interpretation modes (D12) side by side.
# single: one note = absolute major, chromatic allowed, degree "-".
# shell:  lowest note is the root, partners complete the chord.
# diatonic: back to key-aware D19 smart quality.
# Mode/key switches are @-scheduled like the plays: unprefixed lines run
# immediately at parse time, before any pending line fires (D29).
port open out virt as synth
chord out synth
chord mode single
@0   play C
@96  play F# 90
@150 chord mode shell
@192 play C E Bb
@288 play D F C5
@384 play C Eb
@430 chord mode diatonic
@430 key C major
@480 play D
@576 chord stop
advance 672
quit
